meta {
  name: Deactivate User
  type: http
  seq: 8
}

patch {
  url: {{baseUrl}}/users/manage/{{manageUserId}}/deactivate
  body: none
  auth: bearer
}

auth:bearer {
  token: {{businessAccessToken}}
}

docs {
  Global deactivate — sets the tenant-global membership status to INACTIVE,
  blocking login to this tenant. Branch statuses and all records are preserved
  (no hard delete). Cross-tenant safe: the same person stays usable at other
  tenants.

  The tenant's default (primary) business admin — auto-created with the tenant
  and flagged `isPrimaryAdmin` — can never be deactivated. Attempting to do so
  (here, or via a status=INACTIVE on Update User) returns
  403 `CANNOT_DEACTIVATE_PRIMARY_ADMIN`.
}
